# Endpoints

`pnpm endpoints:generate` refreshes `src/endpoints/*` from OpenAPI (`scripts/endpoints.codegen.json`). Generated files are AUTO-GENERATED — do not edit (keep `Types.ts`).

- Calls go through `api` (`@/utils/axios-instance`) only; UI uses TanStack Query when enabled.
- `*Body` request; `*Call` `{ request: { path?, params?, body? } }`.
- Uploads: `toApiBody` · query strings: `toSearchParams`.
- Errors: `getApiErrorMessage` / `extractApiFieldErrors` from `@/utils/api-error`.
- Envelope unwrap: `unwrapApiResult` from `@/utils/api-result`.
